# §82 beats 2+3: same grant set as file_read.ai, but this program reaches
# OUTSIDE its scope (examples/README.md exists — the grant just doesn't
# cover it). The runtime denies with E401 and exits 4; there is no
# operation in the instruction set that can widen or mint authority.
#
#   python -m runtime run examples/capability_escape.ai --caps examples/caps_demo.json
#   -> ERROR E401 ... (exit code 4)

node 001
op const
type string
value "examples/README.md"

node 002
op filesystem.read
input 001
output string

node 003
op emit
input 002
